# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, this rule also matched
# scripts/release/, which holds the packaging and package-audit scripts the
# release workflow and the client-delivery tests both run - they were silently
# excluded from every commit and would have been missing from a fresh clone.
/release/
whisper-bin-x64.zip
ABUD_SHORTS_ENGINE_STATUS*.md
# ...except the canonical one. It is the single status document the project is
# worked from, so it has to survive a fresh clone rather than needing `git add -f`
# forever. The wildcard above still catches timestamped snapshots and backups
# such as ABUD_SHORTS_ENGINE_STATUS_2026-08-25.md.
!ABUD_SHORTS_ENGINE_STATUS.md

# n8n local data and credential exports
.n8n/
n8n-data/
*n8n-credentials*.json

# Test & validation artifacts
*.reltest*
test_data_dir/
data-test/
post-rc-02-results.json
release-validation-evidence.json
responsive-qa-results.json
ga-validation-final-report.json

# Local scratch and manual-QA artifacts. These are produced while checking a
# change by hand and are never part of a build, so they must not reach a clone.
.codex-*.tmp
scratch_*
test-product-*.png
test-product-*.jpg
test-edge-*.mp3
*-Scenes.csv
